   "confidence": 0.95,
   "source": "llm"
  },
  {
   "id": "contributions.1",
   "value": "We introduce an algorithm that attains TRPO's data efficiency and reliable performance while using only first-order optimization, proposing a novel objective with clipped probability ratios.",
